      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:4:3:27:11",
      "text": [
        " قُلْتُ لِأَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) أَ حَجَّ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ ( صلى الله عليه وآله ) غَيْرَ حَجَّةِ الْوَدَاعِ قَالَ نَعَمْ عِشْرِينَ حَجَّةً ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from Sahl Bin Ziyad, from Ibn Abu Najran, from Al A’ala Bin Razeyn, from Umar Bin Yazeed who said, ",
          "‘I said to Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup>, ‘Did Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup> perform a Hajj other than the Farewell Hajj?’ He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Yes, twenty Hajjs’ (in concealment as per the below Hadith)."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "11. A number of our people have narrated from Sahl ibn Ziyad from ibn abu Najran from al-‘Ala’ ibn Razin from ‘Umar ibn Yazid who has said the following: “I once asked abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, ‘Did the Messenger of Allah, O Allah, grant compensation to Muhammad and his family worthy of their services to Your cause, perform any other Hajj besides the farewell Hajj ? 5 He replied, ‘Yes, he did so twenty times . ‘“ "
        ]
      }
    },
